Source Type Syntax Notes Local path <code>source = "./server"</code> No download needed; <code>./</code> or <code>../</code> prefix required Terraform Registry <code>source = "terraform-google-modules/vm/google//modules/compute_instance"</code> Format: <code>NAMESPACE/NAME/PROVIDER</code> GitHub <code>source = "github.com/terraform-google-modules/terraform-google-vm//modules/compute_instance"</code> Full GitHub URL GCS bucket <code>source = "gcs::https://storage.googleapis.com/..."</code> — <pre><code># Always pin module versions from Terraform Registry
module "web_server" {
  source  = "terraform-google-modules/vm/google//modules/compute_instance"
  version = "0.0.5"  # Prevents auto-upgrade to potentially breaking versions
}
</code></pre>
